## Interface: 11509, 20506, 16001
## AllowLoadGameType: vanilla, tbc, camelot
## Title: ZacUI |cff33ff99Buff Reminders|r
## Notes: ZacUI buff reminders: your class's group buffs (Battle Shout, Arcane Intellect, Fortitude, Mark of the Wild...) - a reminder when you or the group miss one, and a tracker of who needs it, with a click to cast.
## Author: Zac
## Version: 3.0.9
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\ZacUI\Media\addonIcon
## X-Category: Interface Enhancements
## Dependencies: Zacui
## OptionalDeps: Readycheck, Readycheck_Reminders
## X-ZacUI-Part: BuffReminders

# Part of ZacUI. Shares ZacUI's namespace (_G.ZacUI, published by
# Core_Boot) and its saved variables (ZacUIDB.buffRem, in profiles).
# Readycheck keeps its own Battle Shout reminder and party tracker; this
# part reads their settings once when asked (the import) and can switch
# Readycheck's off, never anything else.

BR_Data.lua
BR_Core.lua
BR_Icon.lua
BR_Tracker.lua
BR_Import.lua
BR_Config.lua
# Drag to customise in the reminders preview (ZacUI's UIF_PreviewDrag).
BR_PreviewDrag.lua
